-- Hygiene (#481): a control handler's parameter does not capture the body's variable of the same
-- name. `default`'s parameter is named `d` (lib/fail.bc); the site binds it around the body, so
-- the elaboration gives it a fresh name and the body's `d` is the `let d = 1` written here.
--
-- Answer: i32[1]: the body answers its own `d`; nothing is raised.
include fail
main -> i32 =
  let d = 1; with default[i32, i32](0) { d }
